#: ../../source/api/lab_contrib/isaaclab_contrib.assets.rst:15
msgid "Multirotor Asset"
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.multirotor.multirotor.Multirotor:1 of
msgid "Bases: :py:class:`~isaaclab.assets.articulation.articulation.Articulation`"
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.multirotor.multirotor.Multirotor:3 of
msgid ""
"This class extends the base :class:`~isaaclab.assets.Articulation` class "
"to support multirotor vehicles (such as quadcopters, hexacopters, and "
"octocopters) with thruster actuators that apply forces at specific body "
"locations. It is based on the implementation from "
":cite:t:`kulkarni2025aerialgym`."
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.multirotor.multirotor.Multirotor:7 of
msgid ""
"Unlike standard articulations that use joint-based control, multirotors "
"are controlled through thrust forces generated by individual "
"rotors/propellers. This class provides specialized functionality for "
"managing multiple thruster actuators, computing combined wrenches from "
"individual thrusts, and applying them to the multirotor's base link."
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.multirotor.multirotor.Multirotor:20 of
msgid "Key Features:"
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.multirotor.multirotor.Multirotor:13 of
msgid ""
"**Thruster-based control**: Uses "
":class:`~isaaclab_contrib.actuators.Thruster` actuators instead of joint "
"actuators for realistic rotor dynamics simulation."
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.multirotor.multirotor.Multirotor:15 of
msgid ""
"**Force allocation**: Supports allocation matrices to convert individual "
"thruster forces into combined body wrenches (forces and torques)."
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.multirotor.multirotor.Multirotor:17 of
msgid ""
"**Asymmetric dynamics**: Thruster actuators can model asymmetric "
"rise/fall dynamics that reflect real motor behavior."
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.multirotor.multirotor.Multirotor:19 of
msgid ""
"**Flexible configuration**: Supports arbitrary numbers and arrangements "
"of thrusters through regex-based thruster naming patterns."
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.multirotor.multirotor.Multirotor:53 of
msgid "Usage Example:"
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.multirotor.multirotor.Multirotor:56 of
msgid ""
"The allocation matrix maps individual thruster forces to a 6D wrench (3 "
"forces + 3 torques) applied to the base link. The matrix dimensions "
"should be (6, num_thrusters)."
msgstr ""

