"The keys are the actuator names and the values are the actuator "
"instances. The actuator instances are initialized based on the actuator "
"configurations specified in the :attr:`MultirotorCfg.actuators` "
"attribute. They are used to compute the thruster commands during the "
":meth:`write_data_to_sim` function."
msgstr ""

