#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.Multirotor.thruster_names:3 of
msgid ""
"This property aggregates thruster names from all thruster actuator groups"
" configured for the multirotor. The names are ordered according to their "
"array indices, which is important for setting thrust targets and "
"interpreting thruster data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api/lab_contrib/isaaclab_contrib.assets.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.Multirotor.thruster_names:7 of
msgid ""
"A list of thruster names in order. Returns an empty list if actuators are"
" not yet initialized."
msgstr ""

