msgid "Raises"
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.Multirotor.thruster_names:9 of
msgid "If a non-thruster actuator is found in the multirotor actuators."
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.Multirotor.num_thrusters:3 of
msgid "Total number of thrusters across all actuator groups."
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.Multirotor.allocation_matrix:3 of
msgid ""
"The allocation matrix maps individual thruster forces to a 6D wrench "
"vector (3 forces + 3 torques) applied to the base link. This allows "
"converting per-thruster commands into the resulting body-frame forces and"
" moments."
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.Multirotor.allocation_matrix:9 of
msgid "The matrix has shape (6, num_thrusters), where:"
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.Multirotor.allocation_matrix:8 of
msgid "Rows 0-2: Force contributions in body frame (Fx, Fy, Fz)"
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.Multirotor.allocation_matrix:9 of
msgid "Rows 3-5: Torque contributions in body frame (Tx, Ty, Tz)"
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.Multirotor.allocation_matrix:11 of
msgid "Allocation matrix as a torch tensor on the device."
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.multirotor.multirotor.Multirotor.set_thrust_target:3
#: of
msgid ""
"This method sets the desired thrust values for specific thrusters in "
"specific environments. The thrust targets are stored and later processed "
"by the thruster actuator models during the :meth:`write_data_to_sim` "
"call. The actuator models may apply dynamics (rise/fall times) and "
"constraints (thrust limits) to these targets."
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.multirotor.multirotor.Multirotor.set_thrust_target:8
#: of
msgid ""
"Target thrust values. Shape is (num_envs, num_thrusters) or (num_envs,). "
"The values are typically in the same units as configured in the thruster "
"actuator (e.g., Newtons for force, or revolutions per second for RPS)."
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.multirotor.multirotor.Multirotor.set_thrust_target:11
#: of
msgid ""
"Indices of thrusters to set. Defaults to None (all thrusters). Can be a "
"sequence of integers, a slice, or None."
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.multirotor.multirotor.Multirotor.set_thrust_target:13
#: of
msgid ""
"Environment indices to set. Defaults to None (all environments). Can be a"
" sequence of integers or None."
msgstr ""

