#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.multirotor.multirotor_cfg.MultirotorCfg:3 of
msgid ""
"This configuration class extends "
":class:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationCfg` to add multirotor-specific "
"parameters including thruster actuators, allocation matrices, and "
"thruster-specific initial states."
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.multirotor.multirotor_cfg.MultirotorCfg:7 of
msgid ""
"Unlike standard articulations that use joint actuators, multirotors are "
"configured with :class:`~isaaclab_contrib.actuators.ThrusterCfg` "
"actuators that model individual rotor/propeller dynamics."
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.multirotor.multirotor_cfg.MultirotorCfg:19 of
msgid "Key Configuration Parameters:"
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.multirotor.multirotor_cfg.MultirotorCfg:12 of
msgid ""
"**actuators**: Dictionary mapping actuator names to "
":class:`~isaaclab_contrib.actuators.ThrusterCfg` configurations. Each "
"configuration defines a group of thrusters with shared properties."
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.multirotor.multirotor_cfg.MultirotorCfg:14 of
msgid ""
"**allocation_matrix**: Maps individual thruster forces to 6D body "
"wrenches. This matrix encodes the geometric configuration and should have"
" shape (6, num_thrusters)."
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.multirotor.multirotor_cfg.MultirotorCfg:16 of
msgid ""
"**thruster_force_direction**: Direction vector in body frame that "
"thrusters push along. Typically (0, 0, 1) for upward-facing thrusters."
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.multirotor.multirotor_cfg.MultirotorCfg:18 of
msgid ""
"**rotor_directions**: Spin direction of each rotor (1 for CCW, -1 for "
"CW). Used for computing reaction torques."
msgstr ""

