#: ../../docstring
#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.MultirotorData.soft_joint_pos_limits:1 of
msgid ""
"Soft joint positions limits for all joints. Shape is (num_instances, "
"num_joints, 2)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docstring
#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.MultirotorData.soft_joint_pos_limits:3 of
msgid ""
"The limits are in the order :math:`[lower, upper]`.The soft joint "
"position limits are computed as a sub-region of the "
":attr:`joint_pos_limits` based on the "
":attr:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationCfg.soft_joint_pos_limit_factor` "
"parameter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docstring
#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.MultirotorData.soft_joint_pos_limits:7 of
msgid ""
"Consider the joint position limits :math:`[lower, upper]` and the soft "
"joint position limits :math:`[soft_lower, soft_upper]`. The soft joint "
"position limits are computed as:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../docstring
#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.MultirotorData.soft_joint_pos_limits:10 of
msgid ""
"soft\\_lower = (lower + upper) / 2 - factor * (upper - lower) / 2\n"
"soft\\_upper = (lower + upper) / 2 + factor * (upper - lower) / 2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../docstring
#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.MultirotorData.soft_joint_pos_limits:15 of
msgid ""
"The soft joint position limits help specify a safety region around the "
"joint limits. It isn't used by the simulation, but is useful for learning"
" agents to prevent the joint positions from violating the limits."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docstring
#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.MultirotorData.soft_joint_vel_limits:1 of
msgid ""
"Soft joint velocity limits for all joints. Shape is (num_instances, "
"num_joints)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docstring
#: isaaclab_contrib.assets.MultirotorData.soft_joint_vel_limits:3 of
msgid ""
"These are obtained from the actuator model. It may differ from "
":attr:`joint_vel_limits` if the actuator model has a variable velocity "
"limit model. For instance, in a variable gear ratio actuator model."
msgstr ""

